DiesalStyle, plus the menu/object families derived from them) is the work
of "Diesal" (diesal2010) and was originally distributed in 2014 under the
New BSD (3-clause) license, reproduced below. The continuation
maintenance, packaging, and incremental fixes shipped here are by
ChronicTinkerer (2026 onward) and are released under the same license.

Diesal's original copyright header is preserved at the top of each
ported file. Modifications by ChronicTinkerer are noted inline where
they meaningfully change behavior.

